#: classes/class-ispag-supplier-dashboard.php:210
msgid "Access denied."
msgstr "Accès refusé."

#: classes/class-ispag-supplier-dashboard.php:159
msgid "AJAX connection error (supplier statistics)."
msgstr "Erreur de connexion AJAX (statistiques fournisseurs)."

#: classes/class-ispag-supplier-dashboard.php:160
msgid "AJAX connection error."
msgstr "Erreur de connexion AJAX."

#: classes/class-ispag-supplier-dashboard.php:168
msgid "Amount (supplier currency)"
msgstr "Montant (devise fournisseur)"

#: classes/class-ispag-supplier-dashboard.php:187
msgid ""
"Amount purchased from this supplier during the year: unit price × quantity, "
"discount deducted, in the supplier's currency. The year is the one of the "
"order date."
msgstr ""
"Montant acheté auprès de ce fournisseur au cours de l'année : prix unitaire × "
"quantité, remise déduite, dans la devise du fournisseur. L'année prise en "
"compte est celle de la date de commande."

#: classes/class-ispag-supplier-dashboard.php:197
msgid ""
"Average gap between the actual receipt and the delivery date confirmed by "
"the supplier. Positive (red) = late, negative (green) = early."
msgstr ""
"Écart moyen entre la réception effective et la date de livraison confirmée "
"par le fournisseur. Positif (rouge) = en retard, négatif (vert) = en avance."

#: classes/class-ispag-supplier-dashboard.php:195
msgid ""
"Average number of days between the order date and the actual receipt of the "
"goods. Only lines already received are counted."
msgstr ""
"Nombre moyen de jours entre la date de commande et la réception effective "
"des marchandises. Seules les lignes déjà reçues sont comptabilisées."

#: classes/class-ispag-supplier-dashboard.php:183
msgid "Avg. delay"
msgstr "Retard moy."

#: classes/class-ispag-supplier-dashboard.php:170
#: classes/class-ispag-supplier-dashboard.php:181
msgid "Avg. lead time"
msgstr "Délai moy."

#: classes/class-ispag-supplier-dashboard.php:179
msgid "Avg. order value"
msgstr "Val. moy. cde"

#: classes/class-ispag-supplier-dashboard.php:180
msgid "Avg. unit price"
msgstr "Prix unit. moy."

#: classes/class-ispag-supplier-dashboard.php:191
msgid "Change in ordered quantity compared with the previous year."
msgstr "Évolution de la quantité commandée par rapport à l'année précédente."

#: classes/class-ispag-supplier-dashboard.php:188
msgid ""
"Change in purchases compared with the previous year. Empty if the supplier "
"had no purchases last year."
msgstr ""
"Évolution des achats par rapport à l'année précédente. Vide si le "
"fournisseur n'a pas eu d'achats l'année dernière."

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "Cyril Barthel"
msgstr "Cyril Barthel"

#: classes/class-ispag-supplier-dashboard.php:161
msgid "d"
msgstr "j"

#: classes/class-ispag-supplier-dashboard.php:196
msgid ""
"Delivery lead time announced in the supplier record. Used as a reference to "
"compare with the average lead time actually observed."
msgstr ""
"Délai de livraison renseigné dans la fiche fournisseur. Utilisé comme "
"référence pour comparaison avec le délai moyen réellement constaté."

#: classes/class-ispag-supplier-dashboard.php:158
msgid "Error:"
msgstr "Erreur :"

#: classes/class-ispag-supplier-dashboard.php:104
msgid "Full supplier dashboard"
msgstr "Tableau de bord fournisseur complet"

#: classes/admin/supplier-stats-page.php:50
msgid ""
"Hover the ⓘ symbol of a column header to see how it is calculated. Click a "
"header to sort."
msgstr ""
"Survolez le symbole ⓘ d'un en-tête de colonne pour voir son mode de calcul. "
"Cliquez sur un en-tête pour trier."

#: classes/class-ispag-supplier-dashboard.php:216
msgid "Invalid year."
msgstr "Année invalide."

